1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:02,065
Tahun 1889,

2
00:00:02,065 --> 00:00:04,009
Menara Eiffel baru berdiri...

3
00:00:04,009 --> 00:00:07,056
tapi Paris justru terpukau gamelan Jawa!

4
00:00:07,056 --> 00:00:10,467
Ada kampung Jawa berisi
65 orang Indonesia.

5
00:00:10,467 --> 00:00:13,411
Komposer Claude Debussy
betah berjam-jam di sana.

6
00:00:13,411 --> 00:00:15,355
Gamelan mengubah musiknya,

7
00:00:15,355 --> 00:00:17,505
sampai lahir lagu piano Pagodes.

8
00:00:17,505 --> 00:00:19,040
Dia bahkan menulis:

9
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,224
dibanding gamelan,

10
00:00:20,224 --> 00:00:22,794
tabuhan Eropa cuma bising sirkus keliling.

11
00:00:22,794 --> 00:00:24,486
Salah satu gamelan itu...

12
00:00:24,486 --> 00:00:26,037
kini disimpan di Sumedang.

13
00:00:26,037 --> 00:00:26,991
Tim gamelan,

14
00:00:26,991 --> 00:00:28,495
atau tim orkestra Eropa?

15
00:00:28,495 --> 00:00:29,967
Tulis di komentar!
